Maps phone lookup service

Minimal Maps accessibility selectors and detail-field extraction in src/lookup.ts
are adapted from Maps to Lead by Jonathan Henrique:
https://github.com/jhowbhz/maps-to-lead
Reviewed source revision: c22f16e7384e159d22bcb38f8cac6dba7659fc3a

The upstream README and package.json declare MIT; package.json names Jonathan
Henrique as author. The upstream repository did not include a root LICENSE file
when reviewed on 2026-10-16. LICENSE supplies the standard MIT permission text
with attribution to that declared author; no upstream copyright year was stated.

Adaptation is limited to Maps page selectors and reading name, address and phone.
No upstream job, database, dashboard, webhook, enrichment or WhatsApp inference
implementation is included. This service never claims a number supports WhatsApp.
